@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
@token = replace-with-author-token

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Published articles
GET {{base}}/articles

### Filter by tag
GET {{base}}/articles?tag=angular

### One article
GET {{base}}/articles/angular-signals-in-practice

### Create
POST {{base}}/articles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "notes-from-the-desk",
  "title": "Notes from the desk",
  "author": "Hugo Colmenares",
  "date": "2026-10-21",
  "tags": ["journal"],
  "excerpt": "A fifth entry created through the API.",
  "markdown": "## From the API\n\nThis entry was not copied into index.json.\n",
  "published": true
}

### Replace
PUT {{base}}/articles/notes-from-the-desk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "notes-from-the-desk",
  "title": "Notes from the desk",
  "author": "Hugo Colmenares",
  "date": "2026-10-21",
  "tags": ["journal", "markdown"],
  "excerpt": "Updated through the API.",
  "markdown": "## From the API\n\nThe author token can replace the body.\n",
  "published": true
}

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/articles/notes-from-the-desk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
